        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Moreover, as a condition of participating in, and having products covered under, certain federal healthcare programs, such as Medicare and Medicaid, if we market a product that is approved, we may become subject to federal laws and regulations that require pharmaceutical manufacturers to calculate and report certain pricing metrics to the government, including the Average Manufacturer Price (AMP) and Best Price under the Medicaid Drug Rebate Program, the Medicare Average Sales Price, the 340B Ceiling Price, and Non-Federal AMP reported to the Department of Veteran Affairs, and with respect to Medicaid, pay statutory rebates on utilization of manufacturers’ products by Medicaid beneficiaries.",
        "start_character": 99051,
        "end_character": 99751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085490",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085490-6d69b5c703accb17",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085490",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial potential could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are more effective, have a more favorable safety profile, and are more convenient or less expensive than products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 35660,
        "end_character": 35909
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085490",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085490-6d69b5c703accb17",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085490",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or other foreign regulatory approval(s) for their products more rapidly than us, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market or could otherwise make our development more complicated.",
        "start_character": 35910,
        "end_character": 36199
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085490",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-085490-6d69b5c703accb17",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-085490",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize may compete with existing and/or new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 34522,
        "end_character": 34675
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-085490",
